      <style>
        <style-rule element='mark'>
          <encoding attr='color' field='[none:question_1:nk]' type='palette'>
            <map to='#4e79a7'>
              <bucket>&quot;Based on your current strengths, areas of growth and above aspirations, what new learnings, feedback and/or experiences do you need in order to sustain your performance and/or to move 10\% closer to your vision?&quot;</bucket>
            </map>
            <map to='#e15759'>
              <bucket>&quot;How would you like others to describe you as a leader and your leadership approach?&quot;</bucket>
            </map>
            <map to='#f28e2b'>
              <bucket>&quot;Reflect on the feedback you received. What do you need to learn or improve now (next 3 months) and in the long-run (next 12 months)?&quot;</bucket>
            </map>
          </encoding>
          <encoding attr='color' field='[none:question_2:nk]' type='palette'>
            <map to='#4e79a7'>
              <bucket>&quot;Reflect on your future, describe what you envision for your personal and professional growth. Consider your strengths, interests, values, feedback you’ve received, etc.&quot;</bucket>
            </map>
            <map to='#e15759'>
              <bucket>&quot;To be 10\% more successful as a leader, what do you think you could do differently? HINT: Be specific and relate your thoughts back to specific PLPs.&quot;</bucket>
            </map>
            <map to='#f28e2b'>
              <bucket>&quot;What (if anything) may prevent you from making the changes needed to elevate your performance? And how will you overcome your obstacles?&quot;</bucket>
            </map>
          </encoding>
          <encoding attr='color' field='[none:question_3:nk]' type='palette'>
            <map to='#4e79a7'>
              <bucket>&quot;What or who can support you in your growth plan journey? How can they support you?&quot;</bucket>
            </map>
            <map to='#76b7b2'>
              <bucket>&quot;Based on your current strengths, areas of growth and above aspirations, what new learnings, feedback and/or experiences do you need in order to sustain your performance and/or to move 10\% closer to your vision?&quot;</bucket>
            </map>
            <map to='#e15759'>
              <bucket>&quot;What do you believe you are currently doing well as a leader? HINT: Be specific and relate your thoughts back to specific PLPs.&quot;</bucket>
            </map>
            <map to='#f28e2b'>
              <bucket>&quot;What next steps will you take? Be specific and clear.&quot;</bucket>
            </map>
          </encoding>
          <encoding attr='color' field='[none:Calculation_1380212555135471623:nk]' type='palette'>
            <map to='#27d46e'>
              <bucket>&quot;Completed&quot;</bucket>
            </map>
            <map to='#bc0017'>
              <bucket>&quot;Pending&quot;</bucket>
            </map>
            <map to='#ffe10e'>
              <bucket>&quot;In Progress&quot;</bucket>
            </map>
          </encoding>
        </style-rule>
