          </datasource-dependencies>
          <filter class='categorical' column='[federated.02k7e800e8lhrw16s740e08k0tgo].[none:employee_comment_2:nk]'>
            <groupfilter from='&quot;\# There can be several factors that may prevent someone from making the necessary changes to elevate their performance. Some common obstacles include:&#10;If someone lacks the drive or enthusiasm to make changes, they may struggle to take the necessary steps to improve their performance.&#10;&#10;\# The fear of not succeeding or making mistakes can hold individuals back from taking risks and making the changes needed to elevate their performance.&#10;&#10;\#  Sometimes, individuals may not have the necessary knowledge or skills to make the desired changes, which can hinder their progress.&#10;&#10;&#10;To overcome these obstacles and elevate performance, one can take the following steps&#10;&#10;\# Define specific and achievable goals that will help motivate and provide a sense of direction.&#10;\#Seek inspiration from successful individuals or role models who have achieved what you aspire to. This can help fuel motivation and overcome fear of failure.&#10;\# Reach out to mentors, coaches, or colleagues who can provide guidance, advice, and support throughout the process.&#10;&#10;By addressing these obstacles and implementing these strategies, individuals can overcome barriers and make the necessary changes to elevate their performance.&quot;' function='range' level='[none:employee_comment_2:nk]' to='&quot;• Pre-existing mental health issues (ADHD/depression/autism). If I could locate a suitable English-speaking psychotherapist who specialised in those issues and had availability, then I would be able to work on some of these issues - however some are simply a permanent part of me.&#10;• Some requirements need room-to-breathe, i.e. time when there is not higher priority tasks to complete. I have little to no support on my specific task arena, so find it difficult to share the workload. De-prioritising various &apos;non-essential&apos; tasks (e.g investigating/assisting issues for colleagues) might provide some leeway.&quot;' user:ui-domain='database' user:ui-enumeration='inclusive' user:ui-marker='enumerate' />
          </filter>
          <filter class='categorical' column='[federated.02k7e800e8lhrw16s740e08k0tgo].[none:full_name:nk]' filter-group='8'>
            <groupfilter function='member' level='[none:full_name:nk]' member='&quot;Abhijoy Basak&quot;' user:ui-domain='relevant' user:ui-enumeration='inclusive' user:ui-marker='enumerate' />
          </filter>
          <filter class='categorical' column='[federated.02k7e800e8lhrw16s740e08k0tgo].[none:growth_plans_started (copy)_3644326946811133953:ok]' filter-group='4'>
            <groupfilter function='member' level='[none:growth_plans_started (copy)_3644326946811133953:ok]' member='1' user:ui-domain='database' user:ui-enumeration='inclusive' user:ui-marker='enumerate' />
          </filter>
